SUMMARY:Post feed post: Reflexive verbs
DESCRIPTION:Publish on Instagram and Facebook: Feed post.\nOnly if reflexiv
 e verbs is live on spanish-quizz.es. If the release slipped\, move this ev
 ent by the same number of days.\n\nClip: reflexive-verbs-feed.mp4 (tutoria
 l-videos/exports/activity-launch-videos.zip)\nTitle: New activity: Reflexi
 ve verbs\n\nCaption:\nNew on Spanish Quizzes: reflexive verbs.\n\nMe levan
 to\, te duchas\, se acuerda. The pronoun always matches the subject. It go
 es before a conjugated verb\, or attaches to an infinitive or a gerund: vo
 y a ducharme\, estoy duchándome.\n\nSome verbs change meaning with se:\nl
 lamar (to call) → llamarse (to be called)\nir (to go) → irse (to leave
 )\ndormir (to sleep) → dormirse (to fall asleep)\n\n150 practice sentenc
 es in Choose or Type mode\, each with an English translation and an explan
 ation. Free\, no sign-up.\n\nPractise now at spanish-quizz.es\n\nQuick che
 ck: Nosotros ___ acostamos tarde. Answer in the comments.\n\n🎵 Music: "
 Old School Salsa 03" by vjgalaxy from Pixabay\npixabay.com/music/salsa-old
 -school-salsa-03-499570/\n\n#LearnSpanish #SpanishGrammar #ReflexiveVerbs 
 #VerbosReflexivos #SpanishLessons #SpanishPractice #AprenderEspañol #Span
 ishQuiz #LanguageLearning #StudySpanish
URL:https://spanish-quizz.es
