DESCRIPTION:Publish on Instagram and Facebook: Feed post.\nOnly if present 
 continuous is live on spanish-quizz.es. If the release slipped\, move this
  event by the same number of days.\n\nClip: present-continuous-feed.mp4 (t
 utorial-videos/exports/activity-launch-videos.zip)\nTitle: New activity: P
 resent continuous\n\nCaption:\nNew on Spanish Quizzes: the present continu
 ous.\n\nEstoy hablando\, estás comiendo\, está viviendo. Use estar + the
  gerund for what is happening right now.\n\n-ar verbs → -ando (hablando)
 \n-er and -ir verbs → -iendo (comiendo\, viviendo)\n\nThe irregular ones
  to learn: leyendo\, durmiendo\, pidiendo\, diciendo\, yendo\, oyendo.\n\n
 Pronouns go before estar or attach to the gerund\, with an accent: lo esto
 y leyendo = estoy leyéndolo.\n\n150 practice sentences in Choose or Type 
 mode\, each with an English translation and an explanation. Free\, no sign
 -up.\n\nPractise now at spanish-quizz.es\n\nQuick check: Los niños ___ du
 rmiendo. Answer in the comments.\n\n🎵 Music: "Old School Salsa 03" by v
 jgalaxy from Pixabay\npixabay.com/music/salsa-old-school-salsa-03-499570/\
 n\n#LearnSpanish #SpanishGrammar #PresentContinuous #PresenteProgresivo #S
 panishLessons #SpanishPractice #AprenderEspañol #SpanishQuiz #LanguageLea
 rning #StudySpanish
